# Data in, data out, and everything in between. Only code is tracked here.
# Globbed rather than exact: the workflow creates siblings as it goes --
# raw_fresh/ while a download verifies, raw_superseded/ after a promotion,
# out_binmax*/ per signal-track run, smoke/ for end-to-end checks on a slice.
# Naming them one at a time means git status is never quite clean.
raw*/
meta/
work/
out*/
logs/
smoke/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
